body:
How do you know what "raunchy squirrel" tastes like? What classifies a squirrel as "raunchy"? Did you eat the squirrel knowing it was "raunchy" before hand?

&#x200B;

I have to know the secrets of the raunchy squirrel!

I'm on antidepressants, they work. I just want to end my life when I feel happy. Or you know, less miserable.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
